294	/**
295	 * The stage seam: the one place a stage begins and ends.
296	 *
297	 * Everything a reader can say per stage is decided here — when it started,
298	 * when it ended, whether it ran, and what it refused with. A stage after the
299	 * run has halted is recorded rather than skipped silently, because a table
300	 * missing its later rows reads as a run that was never asked for them.
301	 */
